# Inside brackets, line breaks are insignificant, so an `else`'s colon may sit
# on the line after it, as an `if`'s or an `elif`'s colon may there.
#= {result: [3, 2], known_issue: 'FROST-163', inputs: {c: false}}
[
    (if c: 1 else
        : 3),
    (if c: 1
        elif true
        : 2
        else
        : 3),
]
